        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>How to Org... - D: Distill 提炼</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: -apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    max-width: 540px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n\n  /* ===== Top toolbar ===== */\n  .toolbar {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 14px;\n    padding: 12px 14px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .toolbar .hamburger {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n  .toolbar .doc-name {\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .toolbar .divider {\n    color: #c8c8c8;\n  }\n  .toolbar .spacer { flex: 1 1 auto; }\n  .toolbar .icon {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    color: #444;\n  }\n\n  /* ===== Page body / content column ===== */\n  .content {\n    padding: 4px 26px 20px 26px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n\n  /* Scrollbar track on right edge of content area */\n  .scrollbar {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 60px;\n    right: 6px;\n    width: 3px;\n    height: 450px;\n    background: #d0d0d0;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n  }\n\n  /* ===== Bullet lists ===== */\n  ul {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding-left: 22px;\n  }\n  ul.hollow {\n    list-style-type: circle;\n    padding-left: 26px;\n  }\n  ul.solid {\n    list-style-type: disc;\n    padding-left: 22px;\n  }\n  li {\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.78;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  ul.hollow > li::marker {\n    color: #555;\n  }\n\n  strong { font-weight: 700; }\n\n  /* ===== Section heading band ===== */\n  .section-band {\n    background: #eef2ea;\n    padding: 8px 12px;\n    margin: 22px 0 18px 0;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  .section-band .en {\n    color: #4a7a4a;\n  }\n  .section-band .zh {\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    margin-left: 6px;\n  }\n\n  h3.sub {\n    color: #4a8a52;\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin: 20px 0 12px 0;\n  }\n  h3.sub .zh-sub {\n    margin-left: 6px;\n  }\n\n  /* ===== Bottom bar ===== */\n  .bottom-bar {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    align-items: center;\n    background: #f2f2f2;\n    padding: 14px 0;\n    border-top: 1px solid #e2e2e2;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n  .bottom-bar .b-icon {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"toolbar\">\n  <span class=\"hamburger\">&#9776;</span>\n  <span class=\"doc-name\">&#9999;&#65039; 自我...</span>\n  <span class=\"divider\">|</span>\n  <span class=\"doc-name\">How to Org...</span>\n  <span class=\"spacer\"></span>\n  <span class=\"icon\">&#8613;</span>\n  <span class=\"icon\">&#128172;</span>\n  <span class=\"icon\">&#8943;</span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"content\">\n  <div class=\"scrollbar\"></div>\n\n  <ul class=\"hollow\">\n    <li>比如你记录了一个 &#128161;想法，这个想法未来会运用到 撰写书籍里面。你就把这个想法放到撰写书籍&#128218;的文件夹里。当你下次需要撰写书籍的时候，这些想法就可以帮助到你。</li>\n    <li>通未来的可行性整理你的内容，而不是客观的记录这个事件。</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <div class=\"section-band\">\n    <span class=\"en\">D: Distill</span><span class=\"zh\">提炼</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <h3 class=\"sub\">Progressive Summarization <span class=\"zh-sub\">渐进式总结</span></h3>\n\n  <ul class=\"solid\">\n    <li>它依赖于在一段时间内分多个阶段对笔记进行总结。<strong>你只保存你所读的东西中最好的摘录，然后对这些摘录进行总结，再对该总结进行总结</strong>，在每个阶段提炼出内容的精髓。这些 \"层\"就像一张数字地图，可以放大或缩小到你需要的任何细节水平。</li>\n    <li>渐进式总结使你可以为不同的目的以不同的方式阅读笔记：如果你想收集每一个细节，就深入阅读，如果你只需要主要的收获，就在高层次上阅读。这使你能够在几秒钟内审视笔记的内容，以决定它对手头的任务是否有用。</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h3 class=\"sub\">Organize opportunistically <span class=\"zh-sub\">择机整理，一次一点</span></h3>\n\n  <ul class=\"solid\">\n    <li>花费大量的时间来创建高度结构化、完美主义的笔记是很诱人的。问题是，你往往不知道哪些资料最终会有价值，直到很久以后。与其在前期投入大量精力，<strong>不如适时地组织你的笔记，随着时间的推移一点点地整理。</strong></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"bottom-bar\">\n  <span class=\"b-icon\">&#128269;</span>\n  <span class=\"b-icon\">&#128276;</span>\n  <span class=\"b-icon\">&#8853;</span>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
